{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは(´▽｀)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/07/dvc00230.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、ほんとに寒くなってきたよね(；；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日とか寒すぎて普段絶対履かない唯一、一つだけ持ってるズボンを履きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ〜〜暖かかったぁ〜〜〜(大声)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「寒くないの？」\n『まだ若いから全然大丈夫！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってきたけど…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうダメみたいです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この話は置いといて、今日も質問に答えていきますd(^_^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽日本の好きなアーティストは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野カナさんとかYUIさん、ELTさん、東京事変(椎名林檎さん)とか好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性のアーティストだとコブクロさん、最近はFUNKY MONKEY BABYSさんが好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽マヨネーズを何につけるのが一番好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う〜ん…最近はカレーかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まろやかになってすっごい美味しいよ！\nみんなも一度は試してみるべし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽ラーメンはどの味が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味噌！やっぱり味噌でしょ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味噌ラーメンが一番！野菜たっぷりでね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、とんこつはあまり好きじゃないです(；；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽好きな言葉は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"単純に『ありがとう』"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽テディベア以外で好きなぬいぐるみある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱとりあえず、くまのぬいぐるみ！\n実家帰るとたくさんあるよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャラクターなら前書いた他にチップとデールのチップとか、プーさんとか、ディズニーだったら何でも好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽結構食べる方？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ食べます（笑）\n手羽先20？30？食べたけど、まだまだ全然食べれました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時は手羽先に味噌カツにひつまぶしに唐揚げ、サラダ×3、デザート…いっぱい食べたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽女の子のファンってどう思いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ(；；)すーっごく嬉しいです(；；)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッションとか美容のこととか色々話せるし…うん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと色んな方から愛される人になれるよう頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、昨日たくさんのファンレターやプレゼントを頂きました！\n本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/weep.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も言ってますが、皆さんの暖かい言葉が私を成長させる鍵です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日もファンレター一つ一つ読んでて胸が熱くなりました。\nこんなにたくさんの方が応援してくれてる、そんな皆さんに元気や希望、そして笑顔を与えられるように日々のレッスンなど精一杯頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さん一人一人が私の大切な宝物です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もまいやんパワー全開で頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の七変化。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『巻き髪』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/07/dvc00297.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまには大人っぽい私もいかがですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて！\n今日はこれからみさみさと美容室に行ってきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}